      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "the world creator (the one that uploads it and designs it) will always have moderation privilege, wether he joined first or last.\nthe instancecreator will have those powers too, when he leaves, the second person who joined the instance will get them\nthen, the third, and etc...\nhowever i think it would be really cool to actually be able to \"give your rights\" to someone before you leave an instance, it would for sure be useful for our dance clubs activities",
